  "title": "Zucchini Parmesan",
  "description": "This easy zucchini Parmesan is a comforting casserole dish with layers of zucchini, marinara sauce, and cheese, baked until bubbling and delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "Mary Jo"
  ],
